{"meta":{"id":"tt0158552","type":"series","name":"Hechiceras","description":"Tres hermanas (Prue, Piper y Phoebe) se reúnen y desbloquean sus poderes para convertirse en las Embrujadas, las brujas más poderosas de todos los tiempos, cuyo destino profetizado es proteger vidas inocentes de seres malvados como demonios y brujos. Cada hermana posee poderes mágicos únicos que crecen y evolucionan, mientras intentan mantener una vida normal en la época moderna de San Francisco.","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4JRJGWdp8ZzjUPKrge7U5c1aGeu.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ueZFcwAUvkjyAB9beaiqJyg0M8H.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rqweyVru9LSYsL4R0iZdU8nOsip.png","genres":["Comedia","Drama","Misterio","Sci-Fi & Fantasy"],"releaseInfo":"1998-2006","released":"1998-10-07T00:00:00.000Z","imdbRating":"8.2","cast":["Holly Marie Combs","Alyssa Milano","Rose McGowan","Brian Krause","Kaley Cuoco"],"director":["Constance M. Burge"],"writer":[],"links":[{"name":"Holly Marie Combs","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Holly%20Marie%20Combs"},{"name":"Alyssa Milano","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Alyssa%20Milano"},{"name":"Rose McGowan","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Rose%20McGowan"},{"name":"Brian Krause","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Brian%20Krause"},{"name":"Kaley Cuoco","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Kaley%20Cuoco"},{"name":"Constance M. Burge","category":"Directors","url":"stremio:///search?search=Constance%20M.%20Burge"}],"app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Holly Marie Combs","character":"Piper Halliwell","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/smZy91UWhB8bZib6A28kTQ8w9sT.jpg","tmdbId":26469},{"name":"Alyssa Milano","character":"Phoebe Halliwell","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/q5RAaX57dLvlpigAhbX3lCb2dkZ.jpg","tmdbId":24967},{"name":"Rose McGowan","character":"Paige Matthews","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/